00:24:49.820 --> 00:24:53.840
kind of want to hypnotize yourself and
focus yourself on the outcome of how you

00:24:53.840 --> 00:24:59.929
want your film to be and if you do that
I kind of believe that it sends up an

00:24:59.929 --> 00:25:05.659
energy out into the creative world and
that the directing and acting gods bless

00:25:05.659 --> 00:25:09.559
you
and that's what I did every night even

